{"reviews":[{"id":"B000X24G00-0","r":1.0,"t":"All Black Clips delivered broken","x":"Why did all of the black clamps break and none of the white... The black clamps are bad material","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B000X24G00-1","r":5.0,"t":"Butterfly Clamps","x":"These hold the hot roll curlers in place.  Love it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B000X24G00-2","r":5.0,"t":"Does Great Job","x":"In order to achieve a great blow dry, I found sectioning the hair is crucial and these clips REALLY work.  I just section the top, one on each side, front of ears, one on each side of top of crown and that makes five in all.  These HOLD the section of hair nicely and neatly so you can blow dry each section without disturbing the other sections.  These were really inexpensive too.  You can section any way you like.  There is a decent amount in this pack too.  Really glad I got them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B000X24G00-3","r":3.0,"t":"Not great","x":"They are heavy. They dont stay up. They fall over. They dont grasp hair well. Would not purchase again","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B000X24G00-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great product. Would recommend","x":"As a lady who recently went natural this product is a God send for keeping hair in place as I section and detangle. They are small enough to grip my hair but large enough that they would still be useful once my hair grows longer. I would recommend this because they are cheap and durable and they arrived on time","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B000X24G00-5","r":5.0,"t":"Girlfriend loves these","x":"My girlfriend bought these when they were 99 cents and free shipping. She bought them around this time two years ago and still has half the pack. They're great. She goes crazy for these things! Only one or two had broken but, that's because she's too rough with them, the other 4 she's lost haha.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B000X24G00-6","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap quality","x":"I thought they would be salon inspired clips that you see at Sally\u2019s . However they are cheap quality and extremely small . It does not hold hair in place .I should have read the reviews first \ud83d\ude1e","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B000X24G00-7","r":1.0,"t":"Nothing like the advertisement","x":"They are cheap-looking. They are nothing like the advertised picture. Would return them, but didn't pay much so I'm going to give them to my niece as a toy.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B000X24G00-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great!","x":"I have thick hair and was surprised how much these little clips can hold! Basic colors too that go with anything","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B000X24G00-9","r":5.0,"t":"As described. Good quality. Fast delivery.","x":"They are exactly as described.  I have very thick long hair and they hold my hair tightly and do not slip or fall out as they do have strong teeth. Easy to open and that's a plus for me as I have arthritis in my hands. They would also work for thin hair. I have pulled up small strands of my hair and they held that small amount well too. If you need to section your hair in small amounts or pile your hair up, they will hold.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B000X24G00-10","r":5.0,"t":"Nice and tight little clips!","x":"So glad I added these small clamps onto my Wahl Clip and Trim order.  The clamps arrived on time and were packaged very well so no breakage problems.  There are 12 small clamps and they really exceeded my expectations because they clamp tighter than I expected.  A generous supply for a very reasonable price makes for a happy customer!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2012"},{"id":"B000X24G00-11","r":3.0,"t":"Looks were deceiving for me.","x":"The size of the clips was what I was looking for. However, I have fine hair so the clips don't always stay in place. For this reason alone, I wouldn't recommend these Butterfly Clamps. However, if your hair is heavier, then I think you'd be pleased with this purchase. You get enough clamps and price is right.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B000X24G00-12","r":2.0,"t":"Fast Shipping, Perfect Size, but Cheap Quality","x":"I'm returning these as I wasn't really impressed with them. I'm rating this product 2/5 for fast shipping and being the perfect size, but the quality feels really cheap and they even came in slightly warped. Seem to hold pretty tightly but if they feel cheap, who knows how long that'll last.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B000X24G00-13","r":5.0,"t":"Hair clips that dont leave marks in your hair","x":"I know there are great clips for your hair out there. These however are so great I have used them for over 12 years. (Not the same clips just the same style clips) They are not only cheap but don't leave those awful clip marks in your hair.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2012"},{"id":"B000X24G00-14","r":4.0,"t":"they are great clips!","x":"They are great clips, I have hair that is on the thinner side, and they do hold it well, but i find myself adjusting frequently if my hair is pin straight because it slides through easily but other than that, I love them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2012"},{"id":"B000X24G00-15","r":1.0,"t":"Very cheap quality plastic","x":"I've used similar clips in the past that were made of more durable plastic, these just don't hold up that well.  They are very cheap and flimsy.  Spend a few more dollars and get better quality clips!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2014"},{"id":"B000X24G00-16","r":5.0,"t":"work perfect, I'm very glad they're on line","x":"My hairdresser showed me a tip on what to do with these, told me to get them at my local stores. Couldn't find this size.  These are the ones, work perfect, I'm very glad they're on line! Love them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B000X24G00-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good.","x":"Definitely what I got them for. I knew they wouldn't be perfect because they were cheap. For the price, they do the job. If I was spending more than $5 bucks for them, I would be pissed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B000X24G00-18","r":1.0,"t":"The quality is very bad","x":"I got the small clips and they look very cheap made, I\u2019m a salon owner and have been using this for years, they are out of stock at our  local stores so I ordered this, never again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B000X24G00-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great clips","x":"This clips are great for styling your hair. I have very fine hair and have a hard time finding clips to hold my hair. These work great. They arrived faster than I expected as well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2012"},{"id":"B000X24G00-20","r":5.0,"t":"Good clips for the price","x":"These are good clips for the price. My hair is on the thinner side, and these are the right size when I section my hair for touching up my roots and highlighting.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B000X24G00-21","r":3.0,"t":"Not good for choppy layers","x":"I have shoulder length, choppy hair and these just dont work for me.  I need too many of them to hold my hair when when I'm straightening for curling.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2012"},{"id":"B000X24G00-22","r":5.0,"t":"Only clips that I use!","x":"I do not like any other claw clips simply because my hair is to fine. These butterfly clips hold up nice, tight, and neatly. Great product and seller.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2011"},{"id":"B000X24G00-23","r":5.0,"t":"These clips work great and have a fantastic price","x":"I was so excited to find these clips online, because I use them regularly and always loose them! These clips work great and have a fantastic price!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B000X24G00-24","r":4.0,"t":"Okish","x":"I got these to help me with my morning hair styling routine. They are OK, nothing spectacular. They do catch hair occasionally but not too bad","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the clips hold hair tightly and work well for sectioning, including on thick hair.","cites":[3,5,9,10,11,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the low price and good value for the quantity received.","cites":[5,6,11,12,14]},{"text":"A common complaint is cheap or poor-quality material, with some clips arriving broken or warped.","cites":[1,7,8,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the clips do not hold hair well or slip, especially with fine or straight hair.","cites":[4,7,12,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the clips are smaller than expected or unlike the advertised picture.","cites":[7,8]}]},"qa":[]}